---
---

<section id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-left reveal">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">
          <span class="lang-es">Sobre mí</span>
          <span class="lang-en">About me</span>
        </span>
        <h2 class="about-heading">
          <span class="lang-es">Construyo con propósito y precisión.</span>
          <span class="lang-en">I build with purpose and precision.</span>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="about-body reveal" style="--delay: 0.12s">
        <div class="about-bio">
          <p class="lang-es">
            Soy Frontend Engineer con más de 5 años construyendo aplicaciones que escalan sin perder el detalle.
            Actualmente lidero la arquitectura frontend en <strong>Ubidots</strong>, una plataforma IoT usada por equipos
            de ingeniería en todo el mundo.
          </p>
          <p class="lang-es">
            Me apasiona el rendimiento: optimizar dashboards, reducir tiempos de carga y mejorar la experiencia de usuario
            en condiciones reales de producción. Fuera del código, soy speaker, mentor
            y autor publicado en <strong>IEEE Xplore</strong>.
          </p>
          <p class="lang-en">
            I'm a Frontend Engineer with 5+ years building applications that scale without losing the details.
            Currently leading frontend architecture at <strong>Ubidots</strong>, an IoT platform used by engineering teams worldwide.
          </p>
          <p class="lang-en">
            I care deeply about performance — optimizing dashboards, reducing load times, and improving user experience
            under real production conditions. Outside of code, I'm a speaker, mentor, and published author at <strong>IEEE Xplore</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-facts">
          <div class="fact">
            <span class="fact-label">
              <span class="lang-es">Rol actual</span>
              <span class="lang-en">Current role</span>
            </span>
            <span class="fact-value">Senior Frontend Engineer, Ubidots</span>
          </div>
          <div class="fact">
            <span class="fact-label">
              <span class="lang-es">Especialidad</span>
              <span class="lang-en">Specialty</span>
            </span>
            <span class="fact-value lang-es">Rendimiento, visualización de datos IoT</span>
            <span class="fact-value lang-en">Performance, IoT data visualization</span>
          </div>
          <div class="fact">
            <span class="fact-label">
              <span class="lang-es">Comunidad</span>
              <span class="lang-en">Community</span>
            </span>
            <span class="fact-value lang-es">Speaker · Mentor · Google DSC Lead '20–'21</span>
            <span class="fact-value lang-en">Speaker · Mentor · Google DSC Lead '20–'21</span>
          </div>
          <div class="fact">
            <span class="fact-label">
              <span class="lang-es">Publicación</span>
              <span class="lang-en">Publication</span>
            </span>
            <span class="fact-value">IEEE Xplore — Blockchain security</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-heading {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.5vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .about-body { --delay: 0s; transition-delay: var(--delay); }

  .about-bio {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-2);
    line-height: 1.8;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  .about-bio strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }

  .about-facts {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .fact {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 130px 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    align-items: baseline;
  }

  .fact-label {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }

  .fact-value {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .fact { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0.3rem; }
  }
</style>
